  "passage": "Mandy's cat, Cookie, became famous online by accident. Mandy posted a short video of Cookie opening a drawer and taking out a pair of socks. The next morning, the video had thousands of views.\nAt first, Mandy was happy. She filmed Cookie every day. Cookie eating, Cookie sleeping, Cookie sitting in a box-everything became a video.\nAfter a few weeks, Cookie started hiding whenever Mandy picked up her phone. Mandy's brother said, \"Maybe Cookie doesn't want to be a star.\"\nMandy felt bad. She deleted some videos and stopped filming Cookie all the time. Now she only takes pictures when Cookie is relaxed, and she never wakes him up for a video.\nMandy learned that likes from strangers are exciting, but they are not more important than the comfort of someone who trusts you-even if that someone is a cat.",
